# Natural Language Toolkit: IEER Corpus Reader
#
# Copyright (C) 2001-2007 University of Pennsylvania
# Author: Steven Bird <sb@csse.unimelb.edu.au>
#         Edward Loper <edloper@gradient.cis.upenn.edu>
